# hypatia-gemma4 — Q-17 model with Hypatia's runtime defaults baked in.
#
# Goose has no thinking toggle for Ollama providers (block/goose#7617),
# so thinking is disabled at the model layer where every client inherits
# it. Live Goose sessions with default thinking measured 36-73s per
# reply; the harness with think:false measured 0.6s TTFT (docs/q17-eval/).
#
# num_ctx caps the KV cache: Goose sessions otherwise open the model's
# full 128K window, which costs GPU memory Hypatia never uses — kernel
# (~4.6K) + Goose overhead (~5K) + a long session fits comfortably in 32K.
#
# Samplers are Google's recommended Gemma 4 defaults.
#
# Build:   ollama create hypatia-gemma4 -f goose-config/hypatia-gemma4.Modelfile
# Verify:  ollama run hypatia-gemma4 "Reply with one short sentence."  (should be fast, no think pause)

FROM hf.co/unsloth/gemma-4-12B-it-qat-GGUF:UD-Q4_K_XL

PARAMETER think false
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
